title:        Thruster riser (sound effect, Kenney "Sci-fi Sounds")
author:       Kenney (www.kenney.nl)
source:       https://kenney.nl/assets/sci-fi-sounds
license:      CC0-1.0
license-file: none
added:        2026-10-15 by sound-design WP1.2b (starter kit)
notes:        From the pack "Sci-fi Sounds (Kenney)" (archive https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/sci-fi-sounds/6b296f9ecf-1677589334/kenney_sci-fi-sounds.zip, sha256 119340f351a5098ad814f78719438c0da355a9ce8a4c8a3af6a8d48aa3d49e04).
              Derived from Kenney's CC0 recording(s) Audio/thrusterFire_000.ogg: first 3 s, exponential fade-in over 2.95 s and a 30 ms fade-out, so it swells to its end.
              Converted to 48 kHz OGG Vorbis (libvorbis q5, LGPL FFmpeg) by scripts/sounds/curate-starter.ts;
              types riser, chosen by measurement (judge of @jasper/audio-fx accepts it as riser).
              The pack page states the licence (Creative Commons CC0) and the archive holds License.txt saying
              "License: (Creative Commons Zero, CC0)"; credit to Kenney is welcome but not required.
